pbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786821330608651001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"572ea98b-a252-41a6-97c4-a320061ce3fa","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"8a48-2953-d9e8-4266"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe closed development-process audit on bleakish-stational-cob proposed six improvements: escaped-defect metadata, deterministic plan preflight, completion-failure classification, risk-tiered review, proactive code-debt management, and broader maintainership/reviewer evidence. Before turning those proposals into new work, evaluate them against prior audits, janitor remediations, architecture decisions, and related implementation tickets. Prior decisions may be reconsidered only when their original rationale and the new evidence are both explicit.\n\n## Approach\nSearch the canonical ticket/event history for each proposal and its underlying mechanisms. Inspect full ticket state, comments, dependencies, discovered work, and outcomes for relevant audits, janitor runs, design sessions, and implementation tickets. For each recommendation, record: prior effort or decision; why it was chosen; result or unresolved limitation; evidence from the 2026-08-15 frozen process audit that is genuinely new; and a disposition of reaffirm, refine, reconsider, or defer. Add durable comments and semantic links so future proposal work can recover this context without repeating the audit.\n\n## Scope\n- Tracker-only research and documentation; no repository files change.\n- Source proposal: bleakish-stational-cob.\n- Evidence: canonical rebar tickets, comments, relations, and relevant decision records referenced by those tickets.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Each of the six recommendations is mapped to relevant prior audits, janitor work, decisions, and implementation tickets, including original rationale and observed outcome.\n- [ ] Each recommendation is assigned a supported disposition: reaffirm, refine, reconsider, or defer; any changed direction identifies the new evidence that warrants reconsideration.\n- [ ] The source audit and this evaluation carry durable comments with exact ticket aliases and material caveats.\n- [ ] This evaluation is linked to the source audit and materially relevant prior tickets using correct rebar relations; speculative keyword matches are excluded.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"Tracker-only historical evaluation; evidence, dispositions, comments, and semantic links live in rebar tickets, with no repository file changes.","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["audit","process","decision-history"],"ticket_id":"1503-a8eb-aac7-469f","ticket_type":"task","title":"Evaluate process recommendations against prior audits and decisions","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["fedcdd55-b18f-4415-8ada-5e7d245c69e7","ce3591cd-97d2-4bb8-9662-770130434f83","572ea98b-a252-41a6-97c4-a320061ce3fa","08014ac7-4578-4369-9415-71d9dcd42b46"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786821526900471002,"uuid":"5fba63ad-48d6-41fa-87b8-d5dc3a3a49fb"}